  - listening comprehension
  - mock exam
  - test center
  - score calibration
  - spaced repetition
  - forgetting curve
  - Ebbinghaus
  - review scheduling
  - memory retention
  - vocabulary learning
  - CEFR
  - open data
  - REST API
  - TypeScript
